HER JOURNALISTIC OBJECTIVITY.

219
00:10:25,146 --> 00:10:28,845
LEAST UNTIL
A COUPLE OF DAYS AGO.WHAT HAPPENED?

220
00:10:28,845 --> 00:10:31,805
SHE HAD AN INTERVIEW WITH HIM
AND SHE SAID CROSSWHITE...

221
00:10:31,805 --> 00:10:34,372
FREAKED OUT.

222
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:38,376
YOU OKAY?

223
00:10:38,376 --> 00:10:40,683
YEAH, I GUESS I'M JUST... NERVOUS, YOU KNOW?

224
00:10:40,683 --> 00:10:42,293
LET'S START
THE QUESTIONS.

225
00:10:42,293 --> 00:10:44,687
AMBER E-MAILED THIS VIDEO
OF THE CROSSWHITE INTERVIEW

226
00:10:44,687 --> 00:10:47,864
TO A PRODUCER FRIEND
IN L.A. FOUR DAYS AGO.

227
00:10:47,864 --> 00:10:49,779
UH, JUST GOTTA
JUMP RIGHT IN, HUH?

228
00:10:49,779 --> 00:10:52,216
THAT'S RIGHT. YOUR UPHOLSTERY
SHOP WAS STILL OPEN THEN.

229
00:10:52,216 --> 00:10:54,305
THIS THE SCARY PART?WAIT.

230
00:10:54,305 --> 00:10:55,916
[click]

231
00:10:55,916 --> 00:10:57,657
THERE'S A DISCREPANCY
ABOUT THE TIME--

232
00:10:57,657 --> 00:10:59,528
THERE--THERE'S NO DISCREPANCY.

233
00:10:59,528 --> 00:11:02,618
I'VE BEEN LOOKING AT
THE SECURITY CAMERA FOOTAGE--

234
00:11:02,618 --> 00:11:04,489
D-D-DON'T TELL ME
ABOUT S-SECURITY FOOTAGE.

235
00:11:04,489 --> 00:11:06,709
I WAS THERE
WHEN I SAID I WAS THERE.

236
00:11:06,709 --> 00:11:09,669
I CAME HOME, AND MY WIFE WAS
DEAD. I MEAN, DON'T YOU GET IT?

237
00:11:09,669 --> 00:11:12,280
THERE'S--THERE'S A REAL
KILLER OUT THERE SOMEWHERE. OKAY.

238
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:14,848
YOU SAID YOU BELIEVED ME. CALM DOWN.

239
00:11:14,848 --> 00:11:18,068
WERE YOU LYING? WERE YOU LYING, TOO? ARE YOU ONE OF THEM?

240
00:11:18,068 --> 00:11:21,028
PLEASE CALM DOWN. YOU ONE OF THE--I MEAN, WHAT
IS--DON'T TELL ME TO CALM DOWN!

241
00:11:21,028 --> 00:11:24,031
WHAT IS THIS?
WHAT IS THIS, A SET-UP? I JUST--

242
00:11:24,031 --> 00:11:26,686
TURN THAT OFF! TURN THAT OFF! PLEASE--

243
00:11:26,686 --> 00:11:29,471
[click]I'LL GET A WARRANT FIRST THING
IN THE MORNING. GET A LIST

244
00:11:29,471 --> 00:11:32,517
OF AMBER'S MISSING EQUIPMENT
AND THE SERIAL NUMBERS.ON IT.

245
00:11:34,781 --> 00:11:36,783
WE'RE SERVING
A WARRANT ON CROSSWHITE

246
00:11:36,783 --> 00:11:39,394
FIRST THING IN THE MORNING,
AND YOU'RE COMING WITH.

247
00:11:39,394 --> 00:11:40,787
OH, SOUNDS LIKE FUN.

248
00:11:40,787 --> 00:11:42,745
DON'T WORRY.
WE'RE DROPPING YOU

249
00:11:42,745 --> 00:11:46,096
AT CITY HALL SO YOU CAN PAY
THAT SPEEDING TICKET.

250
00:11:46,096 --> 00:11:50,405
I THOUGHT I MADE MY FEELINGS
VERY, UH, CLEAR

251
00:11:50,405 --> 00:11:51,928
ON THAT PARTICULAR SUBJECT--

252
00:11:51,928 --> 00:11:53,974
WHICH IS WHY
I TOLD CHIEF NAIL

253
00:11:53,974 --> 00:11:55,889
IF YOU DON'T PAY IT
BY NOON TOMORROW,

254
00:11:55,889 --> 00:11:58,674
HE'S FREE TO GET
A BENCH WARRANT FOR YOUR ARREST.

255
00:11:58,674 --> 00:12:01,808
WE'RE CITIZENS, TOO.
WE'RE NOT ABOVE THE LAW.

256
00:12:01,808 --> 00:12:04,114
OH, WELL,
THANKS FOR THAT, GANDHI.

257
00:12:04,114 --> 00:12:08,118
WHAT I DON'T APPRECIATE IS THIS
CHEAP POLICE STATE TACTICS.

258
00:12:08,118 --> 00:12:12,253
WHATEVER WORKS.

259
00:12:12,253 --> 00:12:13,602
[knock on door]

260
00:12:13,602 --> 00:12:15,604
HE'S NOT HERE.

261
00:12:15,604 --> 00:12:19,390
WARRANT'S GOOD EITHER WAY,
SO, CHO, OPEN THE DOOR.

262
00:12:26,006 --> 00:12:27,137
[click]

263
00:12:29,313 --> 00:12:32,360
BOSS.

264
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:34,231
FOUND THIS
IN THE GARAGE.

265
00:12:37,931 --> 00:12:40,542
THE SERIAL NUMBER MATCHES
AMBER'S VIDEO EQUIPMENT.

266
00:12:40,542 --> 00:12:43,545
CALL VAN PELT. HAVE HER PUT
A BOLO OUT ON CROSSWHITE.

267
00:12:43,545 --> 00:12:46,766
WE NEED TO BRING HIM IN.

268
00:12:49,594 --> 00:12:51,988
[telephone rings]

269
00:12:51,988 --> 00:12:54,686
THANK YOU.

270
00:12:54,686 --> 00:12:57,037
[clears throat]

271
00:12:57,037 --> 00:13:00,083
UH, EXCUSE ME, MA'AM?
UM, I HAVE A--I HAVE A TICKET.

272
00:13:00,083 --> 00:13:02,129
YES, SEE THAT CLERK.

273
00:13:02,129 --> 00:13:03,434
UH-HUH.

274
00:13:05,567 --> 00:13:08,265
SO... YOU'RE THE BAGMAN.

275
00:13:08,265 --> 00:13:09,745
I GUESS.

276
00:13:09,745 --> 00:13:13,531
WELL, I WOULD LIKE
TO PAY THIS TICKET...

277
00:13:13,531 --> 00:13:16,708
BUT UNDER PROTEST.NOBODY PAYS ANY OTHER WAY.

278
00:13:16,708 --> 00:13:20,103
[gunshot, screams]EVERYBODY STAY WHERE THEY ARE!

279
00:13:29,678 --> 00:13:32,681
NOW, YOU... YOU GET OUT THERE
AND LOCK THOSE FRONT DOORS.

280
00:13:32,681 --> 00:13:35,162
TRY RUNNING, YOU'LL HAVE
BLOOD ON YOUR HANDS. GO.

281
00:13:35,162 --> 00:13:36,467
[cell phone rings]

282
00:13:36,467 --> 00:13:38,208
OKAY. OKAY, EV--
EVERYBODY OVER THERE.

283
00:13:38,208 --> 00:13:40,950
OVER THERE BY THE WINDOW!

284
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:43,344
[sputters, grunts]

285
00:13:43,344 --> 00:13:46,477
[thud, crowd yelling]

286
00:13:46,477 --> 00:13:47,957
GET OVER THERE!

287
00:13:51,569 --> 00:13:53,658
STAY THERE.

288
00:13:58,011 --> 00:14:00,230
NOBODY MOVE!

289
00:14:00,230 --> 00:14:04,539
[sirens wailing]

290
00:14:04,539 --> 00:14:07,368
OH, GOOD. MORE GUNS.

291
00:14:07,368 --> 00:14:10,240
[siren wailing]

292
00:14:12,373 --> 00:14:13,722
[siren stops wailing]

293
00:14:13,722 --> 00:14:15,550
CHIEF. WHAT'S GOING ON?

294
00:14:15,550 --> 00:14:18,205
GOT A REPORT CROSSWHITE'S
IN THERE WITH A GUN.

295
00:14:18,205 --> 00:14:20,598
HE'S GOT HOSTAGES.WE SHOULD SECURE
THE PERIMETER

296
00:14:20,598 --> 00:14:23,601
AND MAKE CONTACT
WITH CROSSWHITE.WELL, THANKS FOR THE ADVICE.

297
00:14:23,601 --> 00:14:26,561
MY PEOPLE AND I
ARE GONNA HANDLE THIS.

298
00:14:26,561 --> 00:14:30,391
YOU DON'T WANT TO START
A GUNFIGHT UNLESS YOU NEED TO.

299
00:14:30,391 --> 00:14:32,872
WE SHOULD GET
THE INFORMATION FIRST.IF I'M HEARING RIGHT,

300
00:14:32,872 --> 00:14:36,614
GOT A GROUP OF CITIZENS IN THERE
BEING THREATENED BY A NUT

301
00:14:36,614 --> 00:14:39,487
WITH A GUN. I DON'T NEED
TO KNOW MORE THAN THAT.

302
00:14:39,487 --> 00:14:41,881
GET OVER THERE!

303
00:14:41,881 --> 00:14:44,405
OTHER--OTHER SIDE! MOVE![woman screams]

304
00:14:44,405 --> 00:14:46,059
MOVE!

305
00:14:46,059 --> 00:14:47,843
I SAID MOVE!

306
00:14:47,843 --> 00:14:49,366
[grunts][woman screams]

307
00:14:49,366 --> 00:14:51,847
OKAY. THREE WITH ME
THROUGH THE FRONT DOOR.

308
00:14:51,847 --> 00:14:55,111
THE REST OF YOU,
HIT THE FIRE EXIT ROUND BACK.YOU START

309
00:14:55,111 --> 00:14:57,505
A SHOOTING GALLERY IN THERE,
AND PEOPLE ARE GONNA GET KILLED.

310
00:14:57,505 --> 00:15:00,116
SEE YOU WHEN WE'RE DONE.CBI HAS AUTHORITY HERE.

311
00:15:00,116 --> 00:15:03,076
I WILL START ARRESTING YOUR MEN
AND PUTTING THEM IN CUFFS

312
00:15:03,076 --> 00:15:05,600
IF YOU DON'T
STAND DOWN RIGHT NOW.

313
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:08,081
CHIEF, THIS IS RIDICULOUS.

314
00:15:08,081 --> 00:15:11,084
NO, SHE'S RIGHT.

315
00:15:11,084 --> 00:15:13,521
CBI HAS JURISDICTION...

316
00:15:13,521 --> 00:15:15,218
FOR NOW.

317
00:15:18,569 --> 00:15:20,571
YOU.

318
00:15:20,571 --> 00:15:21,703
[whimpers]

319
00:15:21,703 --> 00:15:23,574
WHAT'S YOUR NAME?DONNA.

320
00:15:23,574 --> 00:15:26,447
DONNA? YOU LOOK FAMILIAR.
YOU A D.A.?

321
00:15:26,447 --> 00:15:28,057
I'M A PARALEGAL.

322
00:15:28,057 --> 00:15:30,494
[panting]

323
00:15:30,494 --> 00:15:33,454
JANE, RIGHT? CBI?
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

324
00:15:33,454 --> 00:15:36,413
NOTHING. IN FACT, I WAS JUST--
I WAS JUST LEAVING.

325
00:15:36,413 --> 00:15:38,415
I JUST HEARD
ON MY POLICE SCANNER

326
00:15:38,415 --> 00:15:40,940
THAT YOU GUYS WERE
LOOKING TO ARREST ME.

327
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,551
YOU PEOPLE THOUGHT ALL ALONG
THAT I KILLED AMBER, DIDN'T YOU?

328
00:15:43,551 --> 00:15:45,945
WHAT I THOUGHT IS
IRRELEVANT NOW, BUT HOW EXACTLY

329
00:15:45,945 --> 00:15:48,121
IS THIS GUN-WAVING SUPPOSED
TO ESTABLISH YOUR INNOCENCE?

330
00:15:48,121 --> 00:15:51,298
OH, I TRIED TALKING.
IT DOESN'T WORK. NOBODY LISTENS.

331
00:15:51,298 --> 00:15:53,865
[cell phone ringing]MIND IF I GET THAT?

332
00:15:53,865 --> 00:15:55,693
[ring]

333
00:15:55,693 --> 00:15:57,478
[ring]

334
00:15:57,478 --> 00:15:59,480
HELLO?

335
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,438
JANE? ARE YOU IN CITY HALL?

336
00:16:01,438 --> 00:16:02,483
Uh...

337
00:16:02,483 --> 00:16:03,919
YES, UNFORTUNATELY.

338
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:05,181
IS ANYBODY HURT?

339
00:16:05,181 --> 00:16:06,704
NOT MORTALLY, YET.

340
00:16:06,704 --> 00:16:08,619
What's going on?

341
00:16:08,619 --> 00:16:12,362
I'D LOVE TO CHAT WITH YOU,
LISBON, BUT THERE'S A MAN HERE

342
00:16:12,362 --> 00:16:15,539
WITH A LARGE GUN,
WHO WANTS TO TALK TO YOU.WHO'S THIS?

343
00:16:15,539 --> 00:16:17,541
MR. CROSSWHITE,
THIS IS AGENT LISBON.

344
00:16:17,541 --> 00:16:19,500
LET'S JUST TAKE IT EASY,
OKAY?

345
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:22,546
YOU TELL ALL THOSE COPS
TO STAY OUT OF HERE.

346
00:16:22,546 --> 00:16:24,940
I WILL. WHY ARE YOU DOING THIS,
MR. CROSSWHITE?

347
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:27,987
WHY--WHY AM I DOING THIS?
WHY ARE YOUDOING THIS?

348
00:16:27,987 --> 00:16:30,380
I'M NOT DOING ANYTHING
BUT TALKING TO YOU.

349
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:33,949
WHAT DO YOU WANT?I WANT A GUARANTEE
FROM THE GOVERNOR

350
00:16:33,949 --> 00:16:36,952
AND THE STATE ATTORNEY GENERAL
THAT I WILL NOT BE PROSECUTED

351
00:16:36,952 --> 00:16:39,781
FOR THE DEATH
OF AMBER SUTHERLAND.WE CAN TALK ABOUT THAT.

352
00:16:39,781 --> 00:16:41,522
AND I WANT--

353
00:16:41,522 --> 00:16:43,915
I WANT A NEW INVESTIGATION
INTO MY WIFE'S DEATH,

354
00:16:43,915 --> 00:16:46,483
and I want
the real killer found.

355
00:16:46,483 --> 00:16:49,573
DO IT NOW.

356
00:16:49,573 --> 00:16:52,315
I HAD TWO MONTHS
LEFT ON THAT PLAN.

357
00:16:52,315 --> 00:16:55,405
MAY HAVE FOUND A WAY TO HEAR
WHAT'S GOING ON IN THERE.

358
00:16:55,405 --> 00:16:58,495
IF WE CAN PATCH INTO THE MAIN
SWITCHBOARD FOR CITY HALL,

359
00:16:58,495 --> 00:17:00,802
WE CAN TURN ANY PHONE
WITH A SPEAKER ON IT

360
00:17:00,802 --> 00:17:03,239
INTO A MICROPHONE.DO IT. WHERE'S NAIL?

361
00:17:03,239 --> 00:17:06,068
HE'S TAKEN OVER THE CAFE ON
THE CORNER FOR A COMMAND CENTER.

362
00:17:08,418 --> 00:17:10,899
NAIL'S TAPPED INTO
THE CAMERAS AROUND CITY HALL.

363
00:17:15,991 --> 00:17:18,341
IT'S CLEVER.WELL, JUST TRYING
TO KEEP UP.

364
00:17:18,341 --> 00:17:20,474
IT'S THE REAR ENTRANCE
TO CITY HALL.

365
00:17:20,474 --> 00:17:22,998
IT'S ALARMED, BUT WE CAN
DISARM IT FROM HERE.

366
00:17:22,998 --> 00:17:26,436
WE CREATE A DISTRACTION
IN FRONT, SEND MEN IN THAT WAY,

367
00:17:26,436 --> 00:17:29,004
AND WE'LL MINIMIZE CASUALTIES.IT'S PROCEDURE TO TRY
AND TALK THE PERSON

368
00:17:29,004 --> 00:17:32,094
WHO'S TAKEN THE HOSTAGES OUT.
THAT'S WHAT WE'RE GONNA DO.

369
00:17:32,094 --> 00:17:35,358
WORK WITH ME, LISBON.
WE NEED A PLAN "B."

370
00:17:35,358 --> 00:17:39,014
HELL WITH THAT. LET'S GO.WE ARE NOT GOING IN UNLESS
CROSSWHITE FIRES FIRST.

371
00:17:39,014 --> 00:17:40,885
IT'S THE SAFEST PATH.

372
00:17:40,885 --> 00:17:44,063
UNLESS YOU'RE THE FIRST HOSTAGE
CROSSWHITE DECIDES TO SHOOT.

373
00:17:44,063 --> 00:17:47,414
SOMEONE WANT TO TELL ME
WHAT'S GOING ON?

374
00:17:47,414 --> 00:17:50,330
MAYOR BAGSHAW,
I'M AGENT LISBON WITH THE CBI.

375
00:17:50,330 --> 00:17:52,245
GLAD TO HEAR IT.

376
00:17:52,245 --> 00:17:55,422
NAIL, WHAT'S THE PLAN?FLASHBANGS THROUGH
THE SIDE WINDOW,

377
00:17:55,422 --> 00:17:58,251
MOVE IN THROUGH THE BACK,
TAKE CROSSWHITE OUT.

378
00:17:58,251 --> 00:18:00,514
GET STARTED ON IT.

379
00:18:00,514 --> 00:18:03,517
AN ASSAULT LIKE THAT SHOULD BE
THE LAST RESORT, NOT THE FIRST.

380
00:18:03,517 --> 00:18:06,911
A HALF-DOZEN PEOPLE, INCLUDING
MY WIFE, ARE IN THAT BUILDING

381
00:18:06,911 --> 00:18:09,349
WITH AN ARMED LUNATIC.
I WANT THEM OUT.

382
00:18:09,349 --> 00:18:12,482
I WON'T ALLOW IT.
CBI HAS THE AUTHORITY HERE.

383
00:18:12,482 --> 00:18:15,181
NO. NOT ANYMORE.
YOU'RE TO WORK WITH US NOW.

384
00:18:15,181 --> 00:18:19,794
IF YOU DON'T BELIEVE ME, TALK TO
YOUR BOSS. I ALREADY DID.

385
00:18:23,319 --> 00:18:24,277
[clears throat][taps key]

386
00:18:26,496 --> 00:18:28,411
LISBON, IT'S A MATTER

387
00:18:28,411 --> 00:18:31,806
OF TAKING THE FEELINGS
OF THE LOCALS INTO ACCOUNT.

388
00:18:31,806 --> 00:18:34,635
SIR, THIS IS A MATTER
OF PEOPLE NOT GETTING KILLED.

389
00:18:34,635 --> 00:18:37,290
You'll do your best
to prevent that, I trust.

390
00:18:37,290 --> 00:18:39,292
I CAN'T IF I DON'T
HAVE THE AUTHORITY.

391
00:18:39,292 --> 00:18:41,642
NOW I KNOW MAYOR BAGSHAW HAS
A LOT OF INFLUENCE, BUT--

392
00:18:41,642 --> 00:18:44,253
NO, THERE'S NO "BUT." ALL RIGHT?
INFLUENCE HAS INFLUENCE.

393
00:18:44,253 --> 00:18:47,213
I DON'T HAVE TO EXPLAIN
THE POLITICS OF THIS TO YOU,

394
00:18:47,213 --> 00:18:48,431
DO I?

395
00:18:48,431 --> 00:18:50,868
SIR, THIS ISN'T
ABOUT POLITICS.

396
00:18:50,868 --> 00:18:52,914
EVERYTHING'S POLITICS,
LISBON...

397
00:18:52,914 --> 00:18:55,482
one way or another.

398
00:18:55,482 --> 00:18:59,312
TRY PERSUASION.
WORKS WONDERS.[elevator bell dings]

399
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,496
WHAT'S THE WORD?WE'RE ON OUR OWN.

400
00:19:09,496 --> 00:19:11,715
NO, YOU DON'T WANT THEM GOING
IN. WE BETTER DO SOMETHING.

401
00:19:11,715 --> 00:19:14,370
THEY'RE SADDLING UP.TERESA, I KNOW YOU'RE BUSY,

402
00:19:14,370 --> 00:19:16,981
BUT I'M BABYSITTING A BUNCH
OF REPORTERS OUT THERE

403
00:19:16,981 --> 00:19:18,940
WHO'LL TAKE A MINUTE
WHENEVER YOU'VE GOT ONE.NOT NOW, BRENDA.

404
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:20,942
FINE. UH, LET ME KNOW
WHEN YOU CAN.

405
00:19:20,942 --> 00:19:23,988
WAIT A MINUTE. ONE. NOW.

406
00:19:23,988 --> 00:19:25,555
GREAT. UH, ANYONE
IN PARTICULAR?

407
00:19:25,555 --> 00:19:27,383
OR SHOULD I JUST
PICK SOMEBODY?

408
00:19:27,383 --> 00:19:30,517
WHO DO YOU THINK HAS THE BEST
ACCESS TO DIRECTOR BERTRAM?

409
00:19:38,002 --> 00:19:41,005
WE'RE HUMAN BEINGS. WE HAVE
A RIGHT TO USE THE BATHROOM.

410
00:19:42,964 --> 00:19:44,313
THERE'S ONE
IN THE MAYOR'S OFFICE,

411
00:19:44,313 --> 00:19:46,359
JUST RIGHT AROUND
THAT CORNER.

412
00:19:50,711 --> 00:19:53,322
[lowered voice] HEY,
YOU'RE ONE OF THOSE COPS

413
00:19:53,322 --> 00:19:55,194
FROM OUT OF TOWN, RIGHT?

414
00:19:57,718 --> 00:20:01,287
UH, SOMETHING LIKE THAT, YEAH.

415
00:20:01,287 --> 00:20:04,333
ARE YOU, LIKE, WORKING ON
A PLAN TO GET US OUT OF THIS?

416
00:20:04,333 --> 00:20:07,858
YES. OF COURSE I AM.WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

417
00:20:07,858 --> 00:20:12,211
WELL, I'M--
I'M THINKING. AND WAITING.

418
00:20:14,517 --> 00:20:18,347
WHAT ARE YOU, LIKE, 5?
A LITTLE PATIENCE HERE.

419
00:20:22,046 --> 00:20:23,439
[car door closes]

420
00:20:23,439 --> 00:20:27,356
[indistinct conversations]

421
00:20:30,577 --> 00:20:33,971
[tires screech]

422
00:20:33,971 --> 00:20:36,409
[Patrick] THEY'RE GONNA
COME IN, YOU KNOW.

423
00:20:36,409 --> 00:20:38,411
AND IT'S GONNA GET
ALL SHOOTY.

424
00:20:38,411 --> 00:20:40,456
WHAT'S THAT GONNA PROVE?

425
00:20:42,458 --> 00:20:45,374
YOU KNOW WHAT?
DON'T PUT THIS ON ME.

426
00:20:45,374 --> 00:20:48,812
YOU'RE LIKE
ALL THE REST OF THEM.

427
00:20:48,812 --> 00:20:52,338
YOU JUST DECIDED I KILLED AMBER.
S-SAME WAY THEY JUST DECIDED

428
00:20:52,338 --> 00:20:55,210
I KILLED MY WIFE.WELL, MORE TIMES THAN NOT,
IT IS THE HUSBAND THAT DID IT.

429
00:20:55,210 --> 00:20:58,518
YEAH, WELL, I DIDN'T.
THERE WERE BREAK-INS

430
00:20:58,518 --> 00:21:01,564
ALL AROUND THE NEIGHBORHOOD.
THIS WAS A ROBBERY GONE WRONG.

431
00:21:01,564 --> 00:21:04,437
I MEAN, JUST BECAUSE SOME CAMERA
SAYS I WAS SOMEPLACE

432
00:21:04,437 --> 00:21:07,222
WHEN I WASN'T. NO, THEY DIDN'T
EVEN BOTHER TO--TO--

433
00:21:07,222 --> 00:21:10,225
TO LOOK INTO THE ROBBERIES.THAT'S NOT TRUE.

434
00:21:10,225 --> 00:21:11,792
WHAT DID YOU SAY?

435
00:21:11,792 --> 00:21:14,795
WE LOOKED INTO THOSE BREAK-INS.
IT WAS JUST KIDS.

436
00:21:14,795 --> 00:21:17,406
THEY TURNED ON EACH OTHER
THE MOMENT THEY GOT ARRESTED.

437
00:21:17,406 --> 00:21:20,496
THEY'RE NOT KILLERS.DONNA...

438
00:21:20,496 --> 00:21:23,456
YOU SAID YOU WEREN'T
IN THE D.A.'s OFFICE.

439
00:21:23,456 --> 00:21:26,372
NO, I-I JUST SAID
I WAS A PARALEGAL.SOMEBODY KILLED MY WIFE,

440
00:21:26,372 --> 00:21:28,591
AND YOU WERE TOO BUSY
BLAMING ME TO CATCH THEM.

441
00:21:28,591 --> 00:21:31,246
I-I-I'M SORRY I SAID ANYTHING.
PLEASE--

442
00:21:31,246 --> 00:21:33,857
PLEASE DON'T SHOOT ME.
[crying]I'M NOT GONNA
SHOOT YOU. I--

443
00:21:33,857 --> 00:21:39,994
WELL, WAVING THE GUN IN HER FACE
IS NOT A GREAT IDEA.EVERYBODY JUST NEEDS
TO SHUT UP!

444
00:21:39,994 --> 00:21:45,391
[crying]LOOK, I'M SORRY, ALL RIGHT?
I'M SORRY. JUST PLEASE...

445
00:21:45,391 --> 00:21:47,001
JUST STOP IT.

446
00:21:47,001 --> 00:21:49,264
[Donna continues crying]

447
00:21:51,397 --> 00:21:54,661
I CAN HELP HER.YEAH, PLEASE.

448
00:21:54,661 --> 00:21:58,708
[crying continues]

449
00:21:58,708 --> 00:22:02,190
IT'S OKAY. IT'S OKAY.

450
00:22:02,190 --> 00:22:07,326
JUST STAND UP. BREATHE.

451
00:22:07,326 --> 00:22:09,676
JUST COME OVER HERE
AND TAKE A SEAT.

452
00:22:11,895 --> 00:22:14,245
YOU KNOW THE BREATH
IS THE SWITCH

453
00:22:14,245 --> 00:22:17,466
BETWEEN THE CONSCIOUS
AND THE SUBCONSCIOUS MIND?

454
00:22:17,466 --> 00:22:19,860
IT'S HOW ONE
CONTROLS THE OTHER.

455
00:22:19,860 --> 00:22:23,472
JUST BREATHE.
[inhales deeply]

456
00:22:23,472 --> 00:22:26,519
[whimpers]JUST BREATHE AND RELAX.

457
00:22:26,519 --> 00:22:30,349
BOSS, WE'VE TAPPED INTO
THE PHONES AT CITY HALL.

458
00:22:30,349 --> 00:22:33,787
YOU'RE GONNA
WANNA HEAR THIS.[cell phone rings]

459
00:22:33,787 --> 00:22:36,442
LISBON.[Bertram] Agent Lisbon.

460
00:22:36,442 --> 00:22:40,881
I just had a conversation with
a reporter from the "Examiner."

461
00:22:40,881 --> 00:22:44,580
HE SEEMED TO KNOW A LOT ABOUT
THE SITUATION IN CRANE CREEK.

462
00:22:44,580 --> 00:22:46,800
Now, I told him

463
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:52,196
THAT NO MATTER WHAT
ANY UNNAMED SOURCE MIGHT SAY,

464
00:22:52,196 --> 00:22:54,634
CBI puts
civilian safety first

465
00:22:54,634 --> 00:22:56,462
and that we were not bowing

466
00:22:56,462 --> 00:22:59,290
to local pressure
to do otherwise.

467
00:22:59,290 --> 00:23:02,903
I ALSO TOLD HIM
THAT AUTHORITY IN CRANE CREEK

468
00:23:02,903 --> 00:23:07,037
RESIDES WITH OUR HEAD AGENT
IN THE FIELD. YOU.

469
00:23:07,037 --> 00:23:10,389
I've let Bagshaw and his chief
know that you're in charge.

470
00:23:10,389 --> 00:23:12,303
THANK YOU, SIR.

471
00:23:12,303 --> 00:23:15,045
WE'LL DISCUSS THIS AGAIN.

472
00:23:15,045 --> 00:23:17,091
GOOD LUCK, AGENT.

473
00:23:18,309 --> 00:23:21,487
[siren wailing]

474
00:23:21,487 --> 00:23:23,140
[Patrick] In...

475
00:23:23,140 --> 00:23:27,971
[exhales deeply] out.
That's good.

476
00:23:27,971 --> 00:23:32,454
In...
letting yourself relax.

477
00:23:32,454 --> 00:23:36,110
In and out. Just relaxing.WHAT'S HE PLAYING AT?

478
00:23:36,110 --> 00:23:38,591
SOUND LIKE
HE'S HYPNOTIZING SOMEONE....all the way.

479
00:23:38,591 --> 00:23:42,333
Breathing in and out.SIR, WE'RE READY TO GO.

480
00:23:44,292 --> 00:23:48,209
STAND DOWN. NO ASSAULT UNLESS
CROSSWHITE STARTS SHOOTING.

481
00:23:48,209 --> 00:23:50,385
AGENT LISBON
IS IN CHARGE.

482
00:23:50,385 --> 00:23:51,995
THIS IS RIDICULOUS.

483
00:23:51,995 --> 00:23:53,475
IT'S DONE.

484
00:23:53,475 --> 00:23:55,259
GET BACK TO YOUR POST.

485
00:23:55,259 --> 00:23:58,654
Relaxing your body...

486
00:23:58,654 --> 00:24:00,961
IN...

487
00:24:00,961 --> 00:24:03,006
AND OUT.

488
00:24:03,006 --> 00:24:05,792
RELAXING YOUR BODY.

489
00:24:05,792 --> 00:24:07,794
LET YOUR EYES CLOSE.

490
00:24:09,404 --> 00:24:11,972
THAT'S GOOD. THAT'S GOOD.

491
00:24:13,626 --> 00:24:17,368
YOUR MIND IS IN
FIGHT-OR-FLIGHT MODE.

492
00:24:17,368 --> 00:24:19,588
THERE'S NOTHING
YOU CAN DO ABOUT THAT NOW,

493
00:24:19,588 --> 00:24:22,330
SO JUST BREATHE IN...
[inhales deeply]

494
00:24:22,330 --> 00:24:26,421
AND OUT.
LET IT ALL FALL AWAY...

495
00:24:26,421 --> 00:24:29,032
FALL INTO THE FLOOR.

496
00:24:29,032 --> 00:24:32,732
NOW, SEE YOURSELF...

497
00:24:32,732 --> 00:24:35,865
IN A WARM, SAFE PLACE.

498
00:24:56,364 --> 00:24:57,496
[click]

499
00:24:59,889 --> 00:25:02,283
IN... AND OUT.

500
00:25:04,633 --> 00:25:07,506
NOW YOU'RE DRIFTING.

501
00:25:14,121 --> 00:25:15,905
JUST DRIFTING AWAY.

502
00:25:17,951 --> 00:25:20,214
[glass shatters, ricochet][screams]

503
00:25:20,214 --> 00:25:21,171
OOH!

504
00:25:25,785 --> 00:25:29,702
[Crosswhite] THEY TRIED TO
KILL ME. THEY TRIED TO KILL ME.

505
00:25:34,794 --> 00:25:36,273
[Crosswhite] I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.

506
00:25:36,273 --> 00:25:38,928
THEY TRIED TO KILL ME.[Donna moans]

507
00:25:38,928 --> 00:25:41,322
THEY TRIED TO KILL ME.

508
00:25:41,322 --> 00:25:44,717
CLOSE THE BLINDS! GO!

509
00:25:54,553 --> 00:25:57,904
STAND DOWN! DO NOT FIRE!

510
00:25:57,904 --> 00:25:59,514
DO NOT FIRE!

511
00:26:07,566 --> 00:26:09,611
[Cho] ON THE GROUND!
GET ON THE GROUND!

512
00:26:09,611 --> 00:26:11,047
FACE DOWN! DO IT NOW!

513
00:26:13,484 --> 00:26:17,880
[handcuffs clicking]

514
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:20,970
[telephone ringing]

515
00:26:20,970 --> 00:26:24,147
[multiple telephones
ringing]

516
00:26:24,147 --> 00:26:25,714
WELL, WHAT NOW?

517
00:26:25,714 --> 00:26:27,716
YOU GOT ME.

518
00:26:27,716 --> 00:26:31,851
[ringing continues]

519
00:26:31,851 --> 00:26:33,896
YOU COULD ANSWER THE PHONE.

520
00:26:33,896 --> 00:26:35,681
[ringing continues]

521
00:26:38,901 --> 00:26:40,947
AAH!

522
00:26:40,947 --> 00:26:42,644
[ringing continues]

523
00:26:42,644 --> 00:26:44,603
[crash]

524
00:26:44,603 --> 00:26:48,476
WELL, THAT'S GONNA MAKE IT
A LITTLE TRICKY TO TALK TO 'EM.

525
00:26:48,476 --> 00:26:50,696
[ring, crash]

526
00:26:52,523 --> 00:26:54,351
YOU'RE GONNA
TALK TO THEM.

527
00:27:00,531 --> 00:27:03,752
OKAY.

528
00:27:05,798 --> 00:27:09,758
I WANNA TAKE DONNA WITH ME.
SHE'S HURT. SHE NEEDS HE--NO.

529
00:27:12,587 --> 00:27:14,850
WE'RE GONNA BOOK YOU
FOR ATTEMPTED MURDER.

530
00:27:14,850 --> 00:27:18,941
CALL YOUR LAWYER,
YOUR UNION REP, I DON'T CARE.

531
00:27:18,941 --> 00:27:21,509
I'M THE REASON
THAT SUTHERLAND GIRL'S DEAD.

532
00:27:21,509 --> 00:27:24,468
I WANTED TO MAKE IT RIGHT.CHO, GET HIM OUT OF HERE.

533
00:27:24,468 --> 00:27:26,601
[Cho] COME ON.

534
00:27:26,601 --> 00:27:28,864
BOSS--YEAH, I KNOW.
WE LOST THE PHONES INSIDE.

535
00:27:28,864 --> 00:27:31,824
NO, NO, NO. IT'S JANE.

536
00:27:31,824 --> 00:27:34,087
[indistinct conversations]

537
00:27:34,087 --> 00:27:36,089
DON'T SHOOT ME.

538
00:27:36,089 --> 00:27:40,136
[crowd murmuring]

539
00:27:42,748 --> 00:27:46,708
OH, LISBON.
NICE OF YOU TO SHOW UP.

540
00:27:46,708 --> 00:27:49,145
YOU KNOW, YOU PEOPLE OUGHT
TO BE ASHAMED OF YOURSELVES.

541
00:27:49,145 --> 00:27:51,582
CROSSWHITE HASN'T SHOT ANYONE,
AND YOU'VE SHOT DONNA.

542
00:27:51,582 --> 00:27:53,541
IS SHE ALL RIGHT?

543
00:27:53,541 --> 00:27:57,763
UH, FOR A SHOT PERSON, YEAH.
SHE'S FINE. IT'S JUST A GRAZE.

544
00:27:57,763 --> 00:28:00,026
WELL, THAT WAS SERGEANT ROWLEY,
ACTING ON HIS OWN.

545
00:28:00,026 --> 00:28:01,636
SAYS YOU.

546
00:28:01,636 --> 00:28:03,943
LOOK, ROWLEY'S SCREWUPS
HAVE COST ME ENOUGH.

547
00:28:03,943 --> 00:28:05,684
IF IT WASN'T FOR HIM,
NONE OF US WOULD BE HERE.

548
00:28:05,684 --> 00:28:08,774
YOU'RE ANGRY?
HOW DO YOU THINK HE FEELS?

549
00:28:08,774 --> 00:28:10,471
DON'T START TO SYMPATHIZE
WITH HIM.

550
00:28:10,471 --> 00:28:13,082
WHO IS RONALD CROSSWHITE?
HE'S A MAN THAT NO ONE

551
00:28:13,082 --> 00:28:16,042
HAS LISTENED TO, A MAN THAT HAS
BEEN ABUSED AND PUSHED AROUND.

552
00:28:16,042 --> 00:28:19,828
IT'S HARD NOT TO SYMPATHIZE WITH
THE MAN. I DO. I FEEL FOR HIM.

553
00:28:19,828 --> 00:28:22,135
DAMN IT! THIS ISN'T
A THERAPY SESSION!

554
00:28:22,135 --> 00:28:23,919
NO, IT'S NOT.
HE SAYS YOU GOT ONE HOUR

555
00:28:23,919 --> 00:28:26,835
TO PUT HIM IN TOUCH
WITH THE GOVERNOR

556
00:28:26,835 --> 00:28:29,925
AND THE ATTORNEY GENERAL,
OR HE STARTS SHOOTING HOSTAGES.WE'LL GET ON THAT.
IN THE MEANTIME,

557
00:28:29,925 --> 00:28:32,319
COULD YOU ASK HIM TO PLEASE
RELEASE THE INJURED WOMAN?

558
00:28:32,319 --> 00:28:36,584
I NEVER THOUGHT OF THAT.
THAT'S A GREAT IDEA.

559
00:28:42,416 --> 00:28:44,070
[lock clicks]

560
00:28:45,680 --> 00:28:48,074
NOT BAD, CBI.

561
00:28:52,295 --> 00:28:55,690
TELL ME YOU DIDN'T
KILL YOUR WIFE.

562
00:28:55,690 --> 00:28:58,954
I DIDN'T KILL MY WIFE.

563
00:28:58,954 --> 00:29:00,739
HMM. YOU CHEAT ON HER?

564
00:29:00,739 --> 00:29:02,436
NO.

565
00:29:02,436 --> 00:29:05,091
YOU KEPT SOME SECRET
FROM HER.

566
00:29:05,091 --> 00:29:06,701
NO.

567
00:29:06,701 --> 00:29:08,137
YES. THERE'S SOMETHING.

568
00:29:08,137 --> 00:29:10,661
YOU JUST THOUGHT ABOUT IT.
WHAT WAS IT?

569
00:29:12,838 --> 00:29:16,406
I...

570
00:29:16,406 --> 00:29:18,234
I-I WAS A SMOKER.

571
00:29:18,234 --> 00:29:21,716
SHE HATED IT. YOU TOLD HER
YOU QUIT, BUT YOU HADN'T.

572
00:29:24,371 --> 00:29:26,416
WHAT DID YOU DO?

573
00:29:26,416 --> 00:29:28,288
I...

574
00:29:28,288 --> 00:29:31,378
WENT FOR LONG DRIVES,
UH, CLEAR MY HEAD...

575
00:29:31,378 --> 00:29:34,511
SNUCK A SMOKE, FIGURED
WHAT'S THE BIG DEAL, RIGHT?

576
00:29:34,511 --> 00:29:37,819
THAT'S WHAT YOU WERE DOING
THE NIGHT SHE DIED.

577
00:29:37,819 --> 00:29:41,823
UH, I WENT FOR A DRIVE,
I LISTENED TO SOME MUSIC,

578
00:29:41,823 --> 00:29:43,303
HAD A FEW SMOKES.

579
00:29:44,870 --> 00:29:47,437
CAME HOME,
SHE WAS ON THE GROUND.

580
00:29:47,437 --> 00:29:49,570
THERE WAS BLOOD.

581
00:29:52,529 --> 00:29:55,794
PUT MY HANDS TO MY FACE,
SMELLED THE SMOKE ON MY FINGERS.

582
00:30:02,365 --> 00:30:05,586
[voice breaking] THE LAST THING
I TOLD HER WAS A LIE.

583
00:30:05,586 --> 00:30:09,677
AND THAT'S THE GUILT
YOU CARRY AROUND.

584
00:30:09,677 --> 00:30:12,593
I SHOULD HAVE BEEN THERE.

585
00:30:12,593 --> 00:30:14,943
I SHOULD HAVE
BEEN THERE WITH HER.

586
00:30:14,943 --> 00:30:16,597
HAVE YOU EVER CONSIDERED

587
00:30:16,597 --> 00:30:18,599
THAT THE KILLER
WAS WAITING FOR YOU TO LEAVE?

588
00:30:18,599 --> 00:30:22,690
[sniffles] DOES THAT MEAN
YOU BELIEVE ME?

589
00:30:22,690 --> 00:30:24,779
SURE, I GUESS.

590
00:30:24,779 --> 00:30:27,521
BUT TAKING US HOSTAGE
TO PROVE IT

591
00:30:27,521 --> 00:30:29,740
IS THE DUMBEST IDEA
YOU'VE EVER HAD.

592
00:30:29,740 --> 00:30:31,830
DONNA...

593
00:30:31,830 --> 00:30:33,744
THE SECURITY CAMERA FOOTAGE--

594
00:30:33,744 --> 00:30:36,182
THE BIG EVIDENCE AGAINST
MR. CROSSWHITE--WHO OWNED IT?

595
00:30:36,182 --> 00:30:38,227
UH, THE EL-ELECTRIC COMPANY.

596
00:30:38,227 --> 00:30:41,622
PERFECT. AND ROWLEY'S MISTAKE--
THE ONE THAT GOT IT THROWN OUT--

597
00:30:41,622 --> 00:30:44,277
PRETTY STUPID?
HARD TO ANTICIPATE?

598
00:30:44,277 --> 00:30:47,367
OF ALL THE PAPERWORK
TO FORGET,

599
00:30:47,367 --> 00:30:48,716
ROWLEY PICKED THE WORST.

600
00:30:48,716 --> 00:30:51,066
THAT'LL DO.

601
00:30:51,066 --> 00:30:53,590
CROSSWHITE,
FORGET ABOUT THE DEADLINE.

602
00:30:53,590 --> 00:30:56,376
I WILL TELL YOU WHO MURDERED
YOUR WIFE IN 20 MINUTES.

603
00:30:56,376 --> 00:30:58,769
I JUST NEED THREE THINGS.WHAT?

604
00:30:58,769 --> 00:31:00,771
FIRST,
DONNA HERE IS INJURED.

605
00:31:00,771 --> 00:31:02,338
LET HER GO SO SHE CAN
BE TAKEN CARE OF.

606
00:31:02,338 --> 00:31:04,036
THERE'S PLENTY OF US
HERE TO SHOOT

607
00:31:04,036 --> 00:31:06,560
IF THAT'S WHAT
YOU FEEL LIKE DOING.HEY, WHA--

608
00:31:06,560 --> 00:31:08,649
SECOND--I NEED
TO GO TO THE BATHROOM.

609
00:31:08,649 --> 00:31:09,955
OH, ME, TOO.AND ME.

610
00:31:09,955 --> 00:31:13,262
FINE.WE ALL GET TO GO
TO THE BATHROOM.

611
00:31:13,262 --> 00:31:15,874
AND THIRD, I NEED A PEN
AND SOME PAPER.

612
00:31:15,874 --> 00:31:17,963
THAT'S ALL YOU NEED
TO FIND MY WIFE'S KILLER?

613
00:31:17,963 --> 00:31:20,574
YEAH. YOU THINK
THE GOVERNOR CAN SAY THAT?

614
00:31:20,574 --> 00:31:22,010
I DOUBT IT.

615
00:31:22,010 --> 00:31:23,316
OKAY.

616
00:31:35,458 --> 00:31:37,678
[paper rustles]

617
00:31:44,815 --> 00:31:47,731
YOU OKAY TO WALK?OH, I'M FINE. FINE.

618
00:31:47,731 --> 00:31:49,733
TELL KENYON THAT I'M OKAY.
TELL HIM--

619
00:31:49,733 --> 00:31:51,779
NO MESSAGES.
GO AHEAD. OPEN HER UP.

620
00:31:51,779 --> 00:31:53,128
[keys jangle]

621
00:31:53,128 --> 00:31:54,434
[click]

622
00:31:55,957 --> 00:31:56,958
DONNA.

623
00:31:56,958 --> 00:32:00,048
DONNA. SO BRAVE.
OH, SO--

624
00:32:00,048 --> 00:32:03,573
OW! OOH! OOH. OOH.OH! SORRY.
FORGOT ABOUT YOUR...

625
00:32:03,573 --> 00:32:05,662
I'M ALL RIGHT.

626
00:32:05,662 --> 00:32:07,360
MY BAD.

627
00:32:09,275 --> 00:32:12,278
DID JANE TELL YOU TO SAY
ANYTHING? GIVE YOU A MESSAGE?

628
00:32:12,278 --> 00:32:14,933
NO. HE JUST GAVE ME A HUG.

629
00:32:14,933 --> 00:32:17,196
A HUG?

630
00:32:17,196 --> 00:32:18,893
EXCUSE ME.

631
00:32:18,893 --> 00:32:22,331
[police radio chatter]

632
00:32:29,077 --> 00:32:30,339
WHAT'S IT SAY?

633
00:32:30,339 --> 00:32:32,733
"HEY, EVERYBODY.
SOLVED THE CASE.

634
00:32:32,733 --> 00:32:34,822
"SAW ENVELOPE ON MAYOR'S DESK
LEFT BY AMBER.

635
00:32:34,822 --> 00:32:37,129
"MUST BE WHAT THE KILLER
WAS LOOKING FOR.

636
00:32:37,129 --> 00:32:39,958
"CAN'T GET TO IT RIGHT NOW.
YOURS TRULY, JANE.

637
00:32:39,958 --> 00:32:44,049
P.S.--LISBON, I'M NOT
PAYING THE TICKET."

638
00:32:44,049 --> 00:32:46,094
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT THE HELL THAT MEANS,

639
00:32:46,094 --> 00:32:48,096
BUT IN TEN MINUTES,
THE DEADLINE'S UP.

640
00:32:48,096 --> 00:32:50,577
CROSSWHITE SAID HE'S GONNA
START SHOOTING PEOPLE.

641
00:32:50,577 --> 00:32:53,406
NOW, I DON'T CARE
WHAT YOU HAVE ON BERTRAM.

642
00:32:53,406 --> 00:32:55,712
IF THAT PSYCHO HURTS MY WIFE,

643
00:32:55,712 --> 00:32:58,411
I WILL BREAK YOU.

644
00:32:58,411 --> 00:33:00,195
YOUR BALL GAME, LISBON.

645
00:33:04,939 --> 00:33:07,376
SO WHAT HAPPENS NOW?

646
00:33:09,726 --> 00:33:13,165
WELL, WHAT HAPPENS NOW IS,
YOU AND I TAKE A WALK OUTSIDE.

647
00:33:13,165 --> 00:33:16,124
ARE YOU CRAZY?EASY AS PIE.

648
00:33:16,124 --> 00:33:18,822
UH, THEY'LL SHOOT ME.NOT IF I'M STANDING
NEXT TO YOU.

649
00:33:18,822 --> 00:33:20,476
I WON'T TAKE THAT CHANCE.

650
00:33:20,476 --> 00:33:22,652
WELL, YOU CAN TAKE
THE WALK OUTSIDE,

651
00:33:22,652 --> 00:33:25,655
OR YOU CAN STAY IN HERE AND WAIT
FOR THEM TO COME IN SHOOTING.

652
00:33:25,655 --> 00:33:27,701
PERSONALLY, I LIKE
YOUR CHANCES OUT THERE.

653
00:33:27,701 --> 00:33:30,834
I WON'T DO IT. I DON'T EVEN KNOW
WHY I'M LISTENING TO YOU.

654
00:33:30,834 --> 00:33:32,836
BECAUSE I KNOW
WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT.

655
00:33:32,836 --> 00:33:34,838
YOU'RE ON THE EDGE,
AND I'VE BEEN THERE.

656
00:33:34,838 --> 00:33:36,623
IT'S A DARK AND LONELY PLACE,
AND I'M TELLING YOU,

657
00:33:36,623 --> 00:33:38,494
THIS IS THE WAY BACK.

658
00:33:38,494 --> 00:33:41,410
AND MORE THAN ANYTHING ELSE,
I'M OFFERING YOU WHAT YOU WANT--

659
00:33:41,410 --> 00:33:44,109
YOUR WIFE'S KILLER STANDING
IN FRONT OF YOU IN CHAINS.

660
00:33:44,109 --> 00:33:45,632
NOW, IF YOU GO OUT THERE,

661
00:33:45,632 --> 00:33:48,417
THERE'S A CHANCE
THAT YOU WILL SEE THAT,

662
00:33:48,417 --> 00:33:50,941
BUT IF YOU STAY IN HERE,
YOU WILL PROBABLY DIE.THIS IS JUST A TRICK.

663
00:33:50,941 --> 00:33:53,944
OH, I WISH. IF THIS WAS A TRICK,
I'D BE A LOT MORE CONFIDENT.

664
00:33:53,944 --> 00:33:58,732
THIS IS 60/40 AT BEST.
BUT WHAT'S PLAN "B," HUH?

665
00:33:58,732 --> 00:34:00,038
YOU COMING?

666
00:34:08,350 --> 00:34:11,092
[crowd shouting indistinctly]

667
00:34:14,791 --> 00:34:16,837
[doors close]

668
00:34:18,143 --> 00:34:20,232
[police radio chatter]

669
00:34:24,279 --> 00:34:26,455
OH, THAT'S A LOT OF GUNS.

670
00:34:31,547 --> 00:34:34,507
DROP YOUR WEAPON NOW!

671
00:34:34,507 --> 00:34:38,380
[crowd murmuring]

672
00:34:38,380 --> 00:34:40,643
YOU GET CROSSWHITE.
WE'LL GET THE HOSTAGES OUT.

673
00:34:40,643 --> 00:34:43,342
ON YOUR BELLY!
HANDS BY YOUR SIDES!

674
00:34:43,342 --> 00:34:45,126
SPREAD YOUR LEGS
AND DON'T MOVE!

675
00:34:53,526 --> 00:34:55,528
YOU ALL RIGHT?RIGHT AS RAIN.

676
00:34:57,399 --> 00:35:01,838
EASY, RIGSBY. EASY.

677
00:35:01,838 --> 00:35:04,189
[handcuffs click]

678
00:35:08,018 --> 00:35:09,455
[Bertram] JESSICA!

679
00:35:26,167 --> 00:35:29,257
WELL, LOOKS LIKE
YOU HAD IT WRONG.

680
00:35:29,257 --> 00:35:31,564
THERE WAS NO ENVELOPE
ON THE MAYOR'S DESK.

681
00:35:31,564 --> 00:35:33,740
YOU'RE GONNA WANNA SEE THIS.

682
00:35:33,740 --> 00:35:35,872
THERE'S NOTHING THERE BECAUSE
YOU HAVE IT STUFFED

683
00:35:35,872 --> 00:35:39,224
INSIDE YOUR BULLETPROOF VEST.

684
00:35:39,224 --> 00:35:41,878
EXCUSE ME?

685
00:35:41,878 --> 00:35:44,707
AND HE KILLED
AMBER SUTHERLAND.

686
00:35:46,318 --> 00:35:47,928
ARNOLD?

687
00:35:47,928 --> 00:35:51,323
WHAT POSSIBLE REASON COULD
I HAVE TO HURT THOSE WOMEN?

688
00:35:51,323 --> 00:35:54,326
WELL, GINGER, I'M NOT SO SURE
ABOUT YET, BUT AMBER...

689
00:35:54,326 --> 00:35:57,764
SHE FOUND OUT, DIDN'T SHE?YOU GOT YOUR KILLER
RIGHT THERE.

690
00:35:57,764 --> 00:36:00,680
YEAH, AND YOU WERE TERRIFIED
I WAS STARTING TO BELIEVE HIM.

691
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:03,422
IF HE WAS TELLING THE TRUTH

692
00:36:03,422 --> 00:36:06,860
ABOUT WHAT TIME HE CAME HOME
THAT NIGHT...THEN THE SECURITY FOOTAGE
DOESN'T MAKE SENSE.

693
00:36:06,860 --> 00:36:10,907
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?WELL, IT'S UNLIKELY THE ELECTRIC
COMPANY MEDDLED WITH IT.

694
00:36:10,907 --> 00:36:13,693
YOU HAD ACCESS TO THE EVIDENCE
AND YOU CHANGED IT.

695
00:36:13,693 --> 00:36:16,304
AMBER, THE VIDEO EXPERT,
FIGURED IT OUT.

696
00:36:16,304 --> 00:36:19,960
AND THEN YOU KILLED HER.
BUT WHAT YOU DIDN'T KNOW

697
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:22,354
IS SHE LEFT A MESSAGE
ABOUT WHAT SHE FOUND

698
00:36:22,354 --> 00:36:25,357
ON THE MAYOR'S DESK.THERE WAS NO ENVELOPE.

699
00:36:25,357 --> 00:36:29,709
YES, THERE WAS...
'CAUSE I PUT IT THERE.

700
00:36:31,667 --> 00:36:34,279
NOW LET'S SEE IT.

701
00:36:38,065 --> 00:36:41,155
CHIEF NAIL,
TAKE OFF YOUR VEST.

702
00:36:47,205 --> 00:36:49,294
[Velcro rips]

703
00:36:54,212 --> 00:36:56,170
OPEN IT.

704
00:37:01,741 --> 00:37:03,351
READ IT OUT.

705
00:37:04,918 --> 00:37:07,355
"ARREST ME."

706
00:37:09,575 --> 00:37:12,404
OKAY.

707
00:37:12,404 --> 00:37:14,362
LOOK AT THAT, HUH?

708
00:37:14,362 --> 00:37:17,191
YOU DON'T HAVE TO
SAY THAT TWICE.

709
00:37:17,191 --> 00:37:19,149
I'M NOT GOING TO JAIL!

710
00:37:19,149 --> 00:37:20,890
DON'T DO IT!

711
00:37:20,890 --> 00:37:22,152
UHH!

712
00:37:24,590 --> 00:37:26,331
THAT WAS CLOSE.

713
00:37:26,331 --> 00:37:29,377
WE HAVE PEOPLE LOOKING AT
THE SECURITY FOOTAGE RIGHT NOW.

714
00:37:29,377 --> 00:37:31,379
IT'S ONLY A MATTER OF TIME

715
00:37:31,379 --> 00:37:33,947
BEFORE THEY FIGURE OUT
WHAT YOU DID.

716
00:37:33,947 --> 00:37:36,515
NOW YOU'RE A COP
ABOUT TO GO INTO THE SYSTEM.

717
00:37:36,515 --> 00:37:39,605
YOU DO THE MATH.

718
00:37:39,605 --> 00:37:44,653
GINGER CROSSWHITE
GOT HERSELF KILLED.

719
00:37:44,653 --> 00:37:47,265
I WANT YOU
TO UNDERSTAND THAT.

720
00:37:49,397 --> 00:37:52,226
WE'D TALKED AT CITY HALL.
SHE WAS NOT AN INNOCENT.

721
00:37:52,226 --> 00:37:54,315
SHE MARRIED DOWN.
ANYBODY COULD SEE THAT--

722
00:37:54,315 --> 00:37:57,057
I CERTAINLY COULD.

723
00:37:57,057 --> 00:38:00,452
IT WAS CLEAR AS DAY
THAT SHE WAS UNHAPPY.

724
00:38:00,452 --> 00:38:02,323
THERE WAS A CONNECTION
BETWEEN US.

725
00:38:02,323 --> 00:38:06,849
VERY POWERFUL ONE.
AT LEAST, I FELT THERE WAS.

726
00:38:06,849 --> 00:38:10,200
BUT SHE WAS GONNA
TELL THE WORLD...

727
00:38:10,200 --> 00:38:11,854
LIKE I ASSAULTED HER.

728
00:38:16,206 --> 00:38:17,730
DEFILED...

729
00:38:17,730 --> 00:38:21,342
LIKE I WAS SOME

730
00:38:21,342 --> 00:38:23,518
DISGUSTING...

731
00:38:23,518 --> 00:38:25,433
THING.

732
00:38:25,433 --> 00:38:30,743
WHERE'D YOU GET
THE VIDEO OF CROSSWHITE?

733
00:38:30,743 --> 00:38:33,398
I HACKED
INTO THE SECURITY FOOTAGE,

734
00:38:33,398 --> 00:38:36,009
CHANGED THE TIME STAMP.

735
00:38:36,009 --> 00:38:38,751
I HAD CROSSWHITE COLD.

736
00:38:38,751 --> 00:38:42,929
AND THAT IDIOT ROWLEY
FORGOT TO FILE THE WARRANT.

737
00:38:42,929 --> 00:38:44,365
SO CROSSWHITE WALKED...

738
00:38:44,365 --> 00:38:47,803
AND LIVED IN A PURGATORY
YOU CREATED FOR HIM

739
00:38:47,803 --> 00:38:50,763
UNTIL HE MET AMBER,
AND SHE FIGURED OUT

740
00:38:50,763 --> 00:38:52,895
THAT THERE WAS SOMETHING WRONG
WITH THE FOOTAGE?

741
00:38:52,895 --> 00:38:57,335
SAID THE "META-DATA"
DIDN'T MATCH.

742
00:38:57,335 --> 00:39:00,686
SHE HAD NO IDEA
I WAS INVOLVED.

743
00:39:00,686 --> 00:39:04,864
AND SHE SAID THAT SHE HADN'T
TOLD ANYONE ELSE, SO...

744
00:39:04,864 --> 00:39:08,128
I MET HER AT HER HOME.

745
00:39:16,223 --> 00:39:19,574
[gunshots]

746
00:39:25,667 --> 00:39:27,669
AND YOU TOOK HER CAMERAS,

747
00:39:27,669 --> 00:39:30,846
AND YOU PLANTED ONE
AT CROSSWHITE'S.

748
00:39:30,846 --> 00:39:32,848
IN FOR A PENNY.

749
00:39:36,112 --> 00:39:39,899
I THOUGHT THAT...

750
00:39:39,899 --> 00:39:43,293
WHEN I CONFESSED,
I WOULD FEEL A WEIGHT LIFT.

751
00:39:46,209 --> 00:39:48,690
I DON'T FEEL ANYTHING.

752
00:39:51,867 --> 00:39:54,783
CROSSWHITE. IT'S TIME.

753
00:39:57,830 --> 00:40:00,136
HEY, UH...

754
00:40:00,136 --> 00:40:02,269
SORRY ABOUT
THE WHOLE JAIL THING,

755
00:40:02,269 --> 00:40:04,619
BUT YOU DID TAKE
A BUNCH OF PEOPLE HOSTAGE.

756
00:40:04,619 --> 00:40:06,186
I DON'T CARE.

757
00:40:06,186 --> 00:40:08,710
JAIL DOESN'T MEAN ANYTHING
TO ME NOW.

758
00:40:08,710 --> 00:40:12,584
YEAH, WELL, SEE HOW YOU FEEL
ABOUT THAT IN A COUPLE YEARS.

759
00:40:12,584 --> 00:40:15,195
I'LL BE FINE.

760
00:40:15,195 --> 00:40:18,285
I CAN BREATHE AGAIN.

761
00:40:18,285 --> 00:40:21,201
THANK YOU.

762
00:40:26,032 --> 00:40:28,077
[telephone rings in distance]

763
00:40:33,518 --> 00:40:36,608
ARE YOU FAMILIAR
WITH THE REGULATIONS

764
00:40:36,608 --> 00:40:38,566
REGARDING AGENTS GIVING
ANONYMOUS STATEMENTS

765
00:40:38,566 --> 00:40:40,089
TO THE PRESS?

766
00:40:41,700 --> 00:40:44,267
CBI EMPLOYEES SHALL NOT GIVE

767
00:40:44,267 --> 00:40:46,748
ANONYMOUS OR "OFF THE RECORD"
STATEMENTS

768
00:40:46,748 --> 00:40:48,794
TO MEMBERS OF THE MEDIA.

769
00:40:48,794 --> 00:40:52,014
AND WHAT ARE THE REPERCUSSIONS
OF SAID VIOLATION?

770
00:40:52,014 --> 00:40:53,973
SUSPENSION OR TERMINATION.

771
00:40:53,973 --> 00:40:55,191
YES.

772
00:40:57,063 --> 00:41:00,849
HOWEVER, BOTH THE BAGSHAWS
ARE HAPPY. EVERYONE'S ALIVE.

773
00:41:00,849 --> 00:41:03,069
WE CAUGHT THE KILLER.

774
00:41:03,069 --> 00:41:05,245
YES, SIR.

775
00:41:07,203 --> 00:41:09,379
SEE, YOU--YOU FIND
THE RIGHT LEVER,

776
00:41:09,379 --> 00:41:13,122
AGENT,
YOU CAN MOVE THE WORLD.

777
00:41:13,122 --> 00:41:15,647
YOU FOUND THE RIGHT LEVER.

778
00:41:15,647 --> 00:41:18,780
THAT WAS A SMART PLAY.

779
00:41:18,780 --> 00:41:21,000
[chuckles]

780
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:22,871
I HOPE YOU STAY SMART.

781
00:41:29,008 --> 00:41:31,184
WHAT WAS THAT ABOUT?

782
00:41:31,184 --> 00:41:33,969
OH, IT WAS JUST BUSINESS.
WHAT'S THAT?

783
00:41:33,969 --> 00:41:37,190
THIS--THIS IS MY SPEEDING TICKET
THAT I REFUSE TO PAY.

784
00:41:37,190 --> 00:41:39,366
WELL, I'M NOT PAYING IT.

785
00:41:39,366 --> 00:41:41,716
WELL, THEN I GUESS
NO ONE'S GONNA PAY.

786
00:41:41,716 --> 00:41:43,849
I'LL GET BERTRAM TO PAY IT.

787
00:41:43,849 --> 00:41:46,678
[muffled] HOW ARE YOU
GONNA DO THAT?I HAVE MY WAYS.

788
00:41:48,418 --> 00:41:50,246
[telephone rings in distance]

789
00:41:54,729 --> 00:41:56,601
IT'S ON YOUR DESK!

